{
  "esm": "2.4.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_bound_coriolis_u",
    "description": "The bound_coriolis east-face Coriolis + momentum-advection acceleration of the mom6_cgrid: CAu(i,j,k) = mom6_coriolis_clamp4(pvf_u(i,j,k), fv1, fv2, fv3, fv4) - KEx(i,j,k), the MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc bound_Coriolis law (the fv1..fv4 bounds and the min/max clamp at :897-908, then the -d(KE)/dx term at :911-914): fv1 = av(i,j,k)*v(i+1,j,k), fv2 = av(i,j,k)*v(i,j,k), fv3 = av(i,j-1,k)*v(i+1,j-1,k), fv4 = av(i,j-1,k)*v(i,j-1,k), the av*v products at the two q-points at the ends of the east face (av the absolute vorticity, v the north-face velocities of the cells on each side of the face), with the raw potential-vorticity flux pvf_u (the sibling mom6_cgrid_pvf_u) clamped to their range and the zonal KE gradient KEx subtracted. Every region applies the one clamp template, each product written once. SOLID-WALL BOUNDARIES (a basin closed by land, MOM6's zero wall velocities): at j = 1 the velocities v(i,0)/v(i+1,0) sit on the closed south wall, so fv3 = fv4 = 0 (bound to 0) and the clamp range of the real south-row faces includes 0, as MOM6's min/max over fv1..fv4 does. At i = N_I (the east wall face itself) v(N_I+1,*) are velocities of the land cell beyond, so fv1 = fv3 = 0 (the literal MOM6 value at a wall face, whose velocity is 0). The SE corner applies both. (Before this revision the wall regions copied the edge cell's own av/v into the out-of-domain slots, dropping 0 from the range on the whole j = 1 row of real faces.) The rule is a named-op rule (esm-spec 9.6.8), applied once per consumer equation as mom6_cgrid_bound_coriolis_u(pvf_u, av, v, KEx); all four params must be declared [i,j,k] fields (esm-spec 9.6.1 where clause).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:rule", "family:mom6_cgrid", "grid:mom6_cgrid", "op:clamp", "order:0", "bc:wall", "axes:i,j,k"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      },
      {
        "citation": "MOM6 source: MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc bound_Coriolis fv1..fv4 :897-908 and the -d(KE)/dx term :911-914; the face conventions of the mom6_cgrid grid.esm."
      }
    ]
  },
  "operator_imports": [{ "ref": "../grid.esm" }, { "ref": "../stencils/mom6_coriolis_clamp4.esm" }],
  "operators": {
    "mom6_cgrid_bound_coriolis_u": {
      "params": ["pvf_u", "av", "v", "KEx"],
      "match": { "op": "mom6_cgrid_bound_coriolis_u", "args": ["pvf_u", "av", "v", "KEx"] },
      "where": {
        "pvf_u": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "av": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "v": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "KEx": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [[1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }], [2, "N_J"], [1, "N_K"]],
          [["N_I", "N_I"], [2, "N_J"], [1, "N_K"]],
          [[1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }], [1, 1], [1, "N_K"]],
          [["N_I", "N_I"], [1, 1], [1, "N_K"]]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["pvf_u", "av", "v", "KEx"],
            "ranges": { "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }], "j": [2, "N_J"], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_operator",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mom6_coriolis_clamp4",
                  "bindings": {
                    "x": { "op": "index", "args": ["pvf_u", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "f1": { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["v", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] }] },
                    "f2": { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["v", "i", "j", "k"] }] },
                    "f3": {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        { "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] },
                        { "op": "index", "args": ["v", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] }
                      ]
                    },
                    "f4": {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        { "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] },
                        { "op": "index", "args": ["v", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                { "op": "index", "args": ["KEx", "i", "j", "k"] }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["pvf_u", "av", "v", "KEx"],
            "ranges": { "i": ["N_I", "N_I"], "j": [2, "N_J"], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_operator",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mom6_coriolis_clamp4",
                  "bindings": {
                    "x": { "op": "index", "args": ["pvf_u", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "f1": 0.0,
                    "f2": { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["v", "i", "j", "k"] }] },
                    "f3": 0.0,
                    "f4": {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        { "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] },
                        { "op": "index", "args": ["v", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                { "op": "index", "args": ["KEx", "i", "j", "k"] }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["pvf_u", "av", "v", "KEx"],
            "ranges": { "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }], "j": [1, 1], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_operator",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mom6_coriolis_clamp4",
                  "bindings": {
                    "x": { "op": "index", "args": ["pvf_u", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "f1": { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["v", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] }] },
                    "f2": { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["v", "i", "j", "k"] }] },
                    "f3": 0.0,
                    "f4": 0.0
                  }
                },
                { "op": "index", "args": ["KEx", "i", "j", "k"] }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["pvf_u", "av", "v", "KEx"],
            "ranges": { "i": ["N_I", "N_I"], "j": [1, 1], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_operator",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mom6_coriolis_clamp4",
                  "bindings": {
                    "x": { "op": "index", "args": ["pvf_u", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "f1": 0.0,
                    "f2": { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["v", "i", "j", "k"] }] },
                    "f3": 0.0,
                    "f4": 0.0
                  }
                },
                { "op": "index", "args": ["KEx", "i", "j", "k"] }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
